<p>ek jaa'n laakh qareedaar ayaazan billah<br />
pyaase par teero'n ki bouchaar ayaazan billah<br />
na koi yaar na ghamqaar ayaazan billah<br />
har taraf zaalim-o kuffar ayaazan billah</p>

<p>apne rutbe ka kisi ko na shanasaa dekha<br />
dekha pyaase ne jise qoon ka pyaasa dekha<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>teen baari huwe jab pyaas se behosh imaam<br />
aaqirul amr kiya pyaas me rokar ye kalaam<br />
ayyuhannaas mere qatl pa khaincho na husaam<br />
pyaas se teen shab-o roz ki hai kaam tamaam</p>

<p>ab koi pyaaso'n me baaqi nahi mai tanha hoo'n<br />
chaaho paani do mujhe chaaho na do pyaasa hoo'n<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>abhi ye kehna chuka tha pisar-e shaah-e najaf<br />
sou hazaar ahl-e jafaa toot pade tegh bakaf<br />
sab kamaa'n daro'n ke teer aur dil-e shabbir hadaf<br />
gird jallad the aur beech me zehra ka qalaf</p>

<p>hoke behosh gire jab shah-e dee'n ghode se<br />
saath hi kood pada shimr-e laee'n ghode se<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>aaya ghusse me qaree'n shaah ke wo bad aqtar<br />
tegh ek haath me ek haath me khainche qanjar<br />
be adab ne jo ye chaaha ke chadhe seene par<br />
shaah chupke se ye bole ke tehar shimr tahar</p>

<p>sunle dunya me mere baad tujhe rehna hai<br />
tujhse kuch apne yatimou'n ke liye kehna hai<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>keh to doo'n aage amal is pa tu kar ya ke nakar<br />
shimr bola ke bhala qair kaho aye sarwar<br />
kaha sheh ne meri gardan pa chale jab qanjar<br />
qibla roo laash litaa dena udhaa kar chaadar</p>

<p>aur itna tu meri rooh pa ahsaan karna<br />
dekh saidaaniyo'n ke sar ko na uryaa'n karna<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>qatl waaris huwe ab unko sataane se kya<br />
jiska waali na ho us ghar ke jalaane se kya<br />
aap hi rote hain bevo'n ke rulaane se kya<br />
nange sar parda nashino'n ko phiraane se kya</p>

<p>ya to rouze pa nabi ke unhe pahuncha denaa<br />
ya unhe wariso'n ki laasho'n pa bithlaa denaa<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>beti ek chaar baras ki hai sakina meri aah<br />
dekh tu usko tamaache na lagaana gumraah<br />
wo jo roye na gurakhna na daraana lillah<br />
mai ne naazo'n se use paala hai qaaliq hai gawaah</p>

<p>kal talak thi mere seene pa wo sone waali<br />
ab wo hai saaheb-e maatam meri rone waali<br />
____________________________</p>

<p>shimr bola ke sakina ko bohat chahte ho<br />
sheh ne farmaaya ke haa'n sab me hai pyaari mujhko<br />
sang dil bola ke bas qair tum ab kuch na kaho<br />
mai nahi sunta sakina ki sifaarish na karo</p>

<p>main tamaache use maarunga ghurak bhi doonga<br />
jitni di jaayegi eezaa mai usi ko doonga<br />
____________________________<br />
</p>